8	/**
9	 * Build a stateless Plate leaf renderer that wraps `children` in the given HTML
10	 * tag with the given Tailwind class string. Used by `CommentLeaf`,
11	 * `DeletionLeaf`, `InsertionLeaf`, and `ReplacementLeaf` so the shared
12	 * `(attributes, children) → <tag className>` shape lives in one place. Leaves
13	 * with operation-aware rendering (e.g. `DiffLeaf`) opt out of the factory.
14	 *
